{"title":"Alpha Werewolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Werewolf that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 14 times (4.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: frenzyCadenceMult: .7</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>73</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>60</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>60</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>54</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>73</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>60</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>60</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>54</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"alpha-werewolf\" data-map-level=\"45\">Show level 45 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Moonfang&#39;s Lair</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-153\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 183 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"alpha-werewolf\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/moonfang\"><img src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Moonfang</b><span>Lv 37</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Werewolf: <a href=\"#/monster/lycan\">Lycan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/werewolf\">Werewolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/gu